(162,"Ch 10 to 39",["\"Fire escape,\" Ruby said, already sliding a window up. \"It's the only good room.\"", "\"Heard they close Friday,\" David said, looking past him at the house.", "\"They broke things,\" Curtis said, pointing his fork down the table at her.", "\"Every month,\" Reuben said, pushing his glasses up onto his forehead.", "starts with lettuce,\" Curtis said, shaking the cold water off his hands. \"Then it's Skynet.\"", "\"Wait, so the plan is chalk,\" Tyler said, shifting the reel to his other arm.", "\"I know it,\" Lou said, and set down his fork.", "\"It's a sensor,\" Curtis said, pinching the bridge of his nose. \"It's two wires.\"", "\"Thirty years that's been on that wall,\" David said, following his eyes up to the frame."],[]),
